,"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T20:05:34Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T20:13:41Z","body":">  seems to be working correctly now.\r\n\r\nNot entirely correctly, it's still getting `metal` argumet two times.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744341142/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744359515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744359515","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744359515,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jk5pb","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T20:14:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T20:14:24Z","body":"I notice with this change, when running with the `--editor` flag, the main Godot window takes longer to appear and show the Godot logo than previously. I'll see if it is taking longer to launch overall, or if that is just a difference in the app lifecycle.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744359515/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744380503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744380503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744380503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jk-xX","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T20:26:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T20:26:27Z","body":"> I'll see if it is taking longer to launch overall, or if that is just a difference in the app lifecycle.\r\n\r\nI guess some places in the editor that are blocking main thread still need manual event processing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744380503/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744412609","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744412609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744412609,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlGnB","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T20:44:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T20:44:47Z","body":"> I guess some places in the editor that are blocking main thread still need manual event processing.\r\n\r\nYes, removing the AppKit message pump from `process_events` is the cause, if I add this back in:\r\n\r\n```objc\r\nvoid DisplayServerMacOS::process_events() {\r\n\tERR_FAIL_COND(!Thread::is_main_thread());\r\n\r\n\twhile (true) {\r\n\t\tNSEvent *event = [NSApp\r\n\t\t\t\tnextEventMatchingMask:NSEventMaskAny\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tuntilDate:[NSDate distantPast]\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   inMode:NSDefaultRunLoopMode\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  dequeue:YES];\r\n\r\n\t\tif (event == nil) {\r\n\t\t\tbreak;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t[NSApp sendEvent:event];\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nthen the window pops up immediately again.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744412609/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744438351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744438351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744438351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlM5P","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T21:00:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T21:01:22Z","body":"Removing that logic from `process_events` means there is no way for a Godot client application or the Godot editor to ensure the AppKit message pump is processed periodically on the main thread, which is different from other `DisplayServer` implementations. Other frameworks / toolkits, like SDL, glfw, etc have a \"poll events\" function.\r\n\r\nI can see Windows polls the message pump:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/10f6c01b9cf046adeb6d926431f425e3ffd22ac1/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L3679-L3682\r\n\r\nand so does Linux, (at least for Wayland) as it processes events on a separate thread to ensure they are continuously consumed.\r\n\r\nI think that would be a fairly significant and breaking change, but adding that back should be fine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744438351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744444161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744444161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744444161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlOUB","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T21:04:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T21:04:21Z","body":"Yes, I have re-added it back, it's dequeuing events so should not interfere with the same processing done by the `NSApp run`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744444161/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744453661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2744453661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2744453661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jlQod","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-21T21:09:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-21T21:10:20Z","body":"> Yes, I have re-added it back, it's dequeuing events so should not interfere with the same processing done by the `NSApp run`.\r\n\r\nGreat! I'll do a bit more testing, but I think that should resolve any concerns I had.\r\n\r\nI did find a few other places where this would caused a problem, as it wouldn't have been pumping events, like this confirmation dialog loop that doesn't break:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/efc3e3aea78d6faebf25d5ecd260309f8fe865b4/editor/editor_node.cpp#L5635-L5641\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2744453661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2746256089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104397#issuecomment-2746256089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104397","id":2746256089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jsIrZ","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"